Source landscape is broad and unevenly distributed across human-rights monitors, macro/IMF/World Bank material, regional-security and military-economy analysis, academic monographs and articles, plus official Egyptian government releases and some Arabic/Spanish-language coverage. I prioritized high-value overview and deep-context leads, kept preview-only and access-blocked items, and did not extract claims or rank credibility.

